<title>JAPAN: NOVA gains on share split plan fizzle out.</title>
<headline>NOVA gains on share split plan fizzle out.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of NOVA Corporation were flat by midday on Thursday, after earlier climbing on news of a plan for a share split, brokers said.</p>
<p>The language school's shares were flat at 4,810 yen after rising as high as 4,910 yen.</p>
<p>NOVA said on Wednesday it planned a 1.5-for-1 share split on May 20, for shareholders as of March 31.</p>
</text>
